<InfoLayout title="Contact" description="How to contact JH Kim about Still Coding services and bug reports." eyebrow="STILL CODING / CONTACT" locale="en">
  <div class="info-lead"><p>Found a problem or have an idea?</p><p>There is no separate contact form or newsletter at this time. Send service questions and bug reports through the GitHub profile below. Include the app, device and browser, steps to reproduce, and any error message.</p><a class="primary-link" href="https://github.com/kimiyo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <section class="info-section"><p class="section-number">01 / BEFORE YOU WRITE</p><h2>Useful context<br /><em>to include.</em></h2><ul class="info-list"><li>App name and page URL</li><li>Date, browser, and device</li><li>One–two–three steps to reproduce the issue</li><li>Error message or screenshot</li></ul></section>
</InfoLayout>
